        :OPERATOR    "Northwest Orient Airlines";
        :REGION      "Canada";
        :ROUTE       "Tokyo - Elmendorf AFB";
        :SUMMARY     "The crew chose to divert to Sandpit after the No. 1 engine was shut down. The aircraft crashed into the PacifiOcean one mile offshore after overshooting the runway during the emergency landing. A nose gear retraction difficulty in connection with an icing condition or a power loss, which made the aircraft incapable of maintaining flight. Most of the fatalities were from exposure to the frigid water.";
