:3523   :ABORD       "82"^^xsd:int;
        :CASUALTIES  "70"^^xsd:int;
        :CITY        "Near Charlotte";
        :DATE        "1974-09-11"^^xsd:date;
        :GROUND      "0"^^xsd:int;
        :HOUR        "07:34";
        :OPERATOR    "Eastern Air Lines";
        :REGION      "North Carolina";
        :ROUTE       "Charleston, SC - Charlotte, NC - Chicago, IL";
        :SUMMARY     "The aircraft flew too low and struck trees 3.3 miles short of the runway during an approach in fog. Flightcrew's lack of altitude awareness at critical points during the approach due to poor cockpit discipline in that the crew did not follow prescribed procedures. The crewmembers were preoccupied with conversations having nothing to do with the operating the aircraft while conducting an instrument approach. The aircraft was 50 knots too fast and 500 feet below the final approach fix.";
        :TYPE        "McDonnell Douglas DC-9-31".

:2379   :ABORD       "58"^^xsd:int;
        :CASUALTIES  "55"^^xsd:int;
        :CITY        "Patna";
        :DATE        "2000-07-17"^^xsd:date;
        :GROUND      "5"^^xsd:int;
        :HOUR        "07:34";
        :OPERATOR    "Indian Airlines/Alliance Airlines";
        :REGION      "India";
        :ROUTE       "Calcutta - Patna - Lucknow - New Delhi";
        :SUMMARY     "While attempting to land at Patna, the aircraft was too high and the crew attempted a go-around. During the second landing attempt, the aircraft was again high, veered to left and lost altitude until it crashed into houses in the Gardanibagh district and burst into flames. The cause of the accident was loss of control of the aircraft due to crew error. The crew did not followed the correct approach procedure, which resulted in the aircraft being high on approach. The crew then initiated a 'go-around procedure' instead of an 'approach to stall recovery procedure' resulting in an actual stall of the aircraft, loss of control and subsequent impact with the ground.";
        :TYPE        "Boeing B-737-2A8 Advanced".

:4617   :ABORD       "3"^^xsd:int;
        :CASUALTIES  "3"^^xsd:int;
