        :CASUALTIES  "27"^^xsd:int;
        :CITY        "Near Tshikapa";
        :DATE        "2000-08-12"^^xsd:date;
        :GROUND      "0"^^xsd:int;
        :OPERATOR    "Staer Air";
        :REGION      "Congo";
        :ROUTE       "Kinshasa - Tshikapa";
        :SUMMARY     "The plane was approaching Tshikapa and the pilot informed the tower that it was having difficulties with its landing gear. The tower told the pilot to do a low fly-by for an evaluation and then make an emergency landing but the pilot refused and attempted to return to Kinshasa. The plane crashed 40 miles north of Tshikapa.";
        :TYPE        "Antonov AN-26B".

:1646   :ABORD       "4"^^xsd:int;
        :CASUALTIES  "4"^^xsd:int;
        :CITY        "Zifta";
        :DATE        "1968-01-15"^^xsd:date;
        :GROUND      "0"^^xsd:int;
        :HOUR        "07:54";
        :OPERATOR    "United Arab Airlines";
        :REGION      "Egypt";
        :ROUTE       "Cairo - Beirut";
        :SUMMARY     "Ice accretion on the lifting surface of the aircraft accompanied by moderate to severe turbulence, which resulted in loss of aircraft control by the pilot. When he tried to regain control over the aircraft the lifting surfaces were loaded beyond approved design limits, which brought about the disintegration of main parts of the aircraft in the air, and its subsequent impact with the ground.";
        :TYPE        "Douglas DC-3".

:1836   :ABORD       "96"^^xsd:int;
        :CASUALTIES  "87"^^xsd:int;
        :CITY        "near Strasbourg";
        :DATE        "1992-01-20"^^xsd:date;
        :GROUND      "0"^^xsd:int;
        :HOUR        "19:20";
        :OPERATOR    "Air Inter";
        :REGION      "France";
        :ROUTE       "Lyon - Strasbourg";
        :SUMMARY     "The aircraft hit a mountain while on approach to Strasbourg. Design deficiencies with the mode selector switch. An incorrectly set flight control system resulted in an excessive rate of descent that went undetected.  The crew inadvertently selected 3,300 fpm descent rate on approach instead of 3.3 degree flight path angle.";
        :TYPE        "Airbus A320-111".

:21     :ABORD       "79"^^xsd:int;
