        :HOUR        "10:30";
        :OPERATOR    "Ameriflight";
        :REGION      "California";
        :ROUTE       "Tonopath - Bishop";
        :SUMMARY     "The cargo plane crashed into a mountain en route. The pilot's failure to follow procedures and directives and his failure to maintain clearance from mountainous terrain.";
