        :HOUR        "10:10";
        :OPERATOR    "Southern Sudan Air Connection";
        :REGION      "Sudan";
        :ROUTE       "Wau - Rumbek - Juba";
        :SUMMARY     "The pilot radioed a control tower in the city of Rumbek just before the crash, requesting permission to land because one of the engines had technical problems. A few minutes later, the tower lost contact with the plane. The Minister of Defense, and an adviser to the Southern Sudan president, were among the dead.";
        :TYPE        "Beechcraft 1900C".

